{
    "song_id": 3948735,
    "title": "Morph",
    "language": "en",
    "lyricists": "[50268, 574050]",
    "lyrics": [
        {
            "section_id": "section_0",
            "type": "verse",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "Can't stop thinking about if and when I die",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "For now, I see that \"if\" and \"when\" are truly different cries",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "For \"if\" is purely panic and \"when\" is solemn sorrow",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "And one invades today while the other spies tomorrow",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "We're surrounded and we're hounded",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "There's no above or under or around it",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "For \"above\" is blind belief and \"under\" is sword to sleeve",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "And \"around\" is scientific miracle, let's pick \"above\" and see",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "8",
                    "text": "For if and when we go above, the question still remains",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "9",
                    "text": "Are we still in love and is it possible we feel the same?",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "10",
                    "text": "And that's when goin' under starts to take my wonder",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "11",
                    "text": "But until that time, I'll try to sing this",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_1",
            "type": "chorus",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "If I keep moving, they won't know",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "I'll morph to someone else",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "What they throw at me's too slow",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "I'll morph to someone else, I'm just a ghost",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "I'll morph to someone else",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "A defense mechanism mode",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_2",
            "type": "verse",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "He'll always try to stop me, that Nicolas Bourbaki",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "He's got no friends close but those who know him most know",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "He goes by Nico, he told me I'm a copy",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "When I'd hear him mock me, that's almost stopped me",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "Well, we're surrounded and we're hounded",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "There's no above or a secret door",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "What are we here for",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "If not to run straight through all our tormentors?",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "8",
                    "text": "But until that time, I'll try to sing this",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
